          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EInsurance (including Covid cover) \u00A346\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ESingle room supplement \u00A399\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ELunches\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EDonations at any churches or cathedrals visited\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ENB: If you are a member of the National Trust, or a member of the English Heritage, to qualify for the \u00A31,545 per person price, you will need to present a valid membership card on arrival at ALL attractions on the Isle of Man\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFlight details may be subject to change. Price based on twin share. Minimum numbers required. Normal booking conditions apply.\u003C/p\u003E\n"
          }
        },
